    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Specification of the TravelPerk Open API. TravelPerk is a business-travel management platform; its REST API exposes trips and bookings, invoices and invoice lines, invoice profiles, cost centers, traveler/member provisioning (SCIM 2.0), and webhooks. Requests are authenticated with an OAuth 2.0 access token (or API key) passed in the Authorization header, and an `Api-Version` header selects the API version.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: TravelPerk Developer Support",
